      "source_section": "证据相关性：九路共享信息与重复计数",
      "source_excerpt": "MIL、femba_features、femba_mean、femba_temporal、case_retrieval共享FEMBA编码表征；spectral与spectral_compact共享频谱；spatial_covariance与filterbank_csp共享空间协方差；所有工具还共享当前原始窗口。",
      "source_sha256": "4dd9fa3c6666b311eb314ade09d372a0d2029b249b8dac5b131dbe21bf03a176"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-spectral",
      "kind": "feature_source",
      "source": "spectral",
      "source_section": "证据相关性：九路共享信息与重复计数",
      "source_excerpt": "MIL、femba_features、femba_mean、femba_temporal、case_retrieval共享FEMBA编码表征；spectral与spectral_compact共享频谱；spatial_covariance与filterbank_csp共享空间协方差；所有工具还共享当前原始窗口。",
